# Google Play publisher service-account keys.
# The real key lives OUTSIDE the repo (~/.config/jsp/play-publisher.json); these patterns
# are belt-and-suspenders so a key can never be committed if it lands here by accident.
play-publisher*.json
*-service-account.json
*.sa.json

